### Processing API — HTTP requests for testing with VS Code REST Client
### Base URL: https://localhost:5001

@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### POST — Initiate engine processing for a session
### Precondition: session must be in Ingesting status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/processing/sessions/{{sessionId}}/initiate
Content-Type: application/json

